        },
        {
          "id": "rnnzkz088lkr",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "We have received some reports that other ISPs in India may be impacted by access limitations. We continue to follow up through all available channels to resolve this issue. We have engaged multiple teams at Supabase communicating with multiple entities in India in an effort to do all we can to resolve the access issues our users in India are experiencing.\n\nWe advise affected customers to continue to report the issue to their ISP and to use an alternative DNS provider or a VPN as a workaround in the interim.\n\nWe will post an update once the issue is resolved or additional information becomes available.",
          "incident_id": "xmgq69x4brfk",
